<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Verification of Dependent</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        td {
            padding: 8px 0;
            vertical-align: top;
        }
        .header-section {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-start;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .title-block {
            flex-grow: 1;
        }
        .info-block {
            width: 30%;
            text-align: right;
        }
        h1, h2 {
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 0;
        }
        .section-title {
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .signature-line {
            margin-top: 50px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }
        .signature-box {
            border-bottom: 1px solid black;
            width: 40%;
            height: 30px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="University Logo" style="height: 50px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">University of Texas at Arlington</h1>
            <h2 style="font-size: 16pt; margin: 5px 0 0 0;">Office of Financial Aid</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="header-section">
            <div class="title-block">
                <h2 style="font-size: 18pt;">2022-2023</h2>
                <h1 style="font-size: 22pt;">Verification of Dependent</h1>
                <h2 style="font-size: 16pt;">Support – STUDENT</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="info-block">
                <p>Office: <span data-field="office_location">{{ office_location }}</span></p>
                <p>Phone: <span data-field="office_phone">{{ office_phone }}</span> Fax: <span data-field="office_fax">{{ office_fax }}</span></p>
                <p>Mail: PO Box <span data-field="mailing_box">{{ mailing_box }}</span>, Arlington, TX <span data-field="zip_code">{{ zip_code }}</span> Email: <span data-field="office_email">{{ office_email }}</span></p>
                <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 15px;">PLEASE DO NOT SUBMIT SENSITIVE PERSONAL INFORMATION VIA EMAIL</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-title">Student's Name: <span data-field="student_name">{{ student_name }}</span></div>
        <div class="section-title">UTA ID: <span data-field="uta_id">{{ uta_id }}</span></div>

        <p>You indicated on your 2022-2023 application that you support one or more dependents and will continue to provide the support from July 1, 2022 through June 30, 2023. Please verify below for whom you provide support (food, clothing, shelter, medical needs, dependent care, etc.), the person's age and relationship to you, and the % of the person's support you provide, and the financial resources you use to provide the support.</p>

        <table style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <td style="width: 20%;">Provide the person's name, age, and relationship to you.</td>
                    <td style="width: 30%;">Does this person live with you in a house/apt which you rent or own?</td>
                    <td style="width: 25%;">% of the person's support you provide?</td>
                    <td style="width: 25%;">What financial resources do you use to provide support for this person?</td>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {% for item in dependents %}
                <tr>
                    <td>
                        <span data-field="dependents[{{ loop.index0 }}].name">{{ item.name }}</span><br>
                        Age: <span data-field="dependents[{{ loop.index0 }}].age">{{ item.age }}</span><br>
                        Relationship: <span data-field="dependents[{{ loop.index0 }}].relationship">{{ item.relationship }}</span>
                    </td>
                    <td>
                        <input type="radio" name="residence_{{ loop.index0 }}" value="yes"> Yes<br>
                        <input type="radio" name="residence_{{ loop.index0 }}" value="no"> No
                    </td>
                    <td>
                        <input type="radio" name="percent_{{ loop.index0 }}_none" value="none"> None<br>
                        <input type="radio" name="percent_{{ loop.index0 }}_25" value="25"> 1 to 25%<br>
                        <input type="radio" name="percent_{{ loop.index0 }}_50" value="50"> 26 to 50%<br>
                        <input type="radio" name="percent_{{ loop.index0 }}_75" value="75"> 51 to 75%<br>
                        <input type="radio" name="percent_{{ loop.index0 }}_100" value="100"> 76% to 100%
                    </td>
                    <td>
                        <input type="checkbox" name="resource_{{ loop.index0 }}_earned" value="earned"> Earned income<br>
                        <input type="checkbox" name="resource_{{ loop.index0 }}_untaxed" value="untaxed"> Untaxed income/benefits<br>
                        <input type="checkbox" name="resource_{{ loop.index0 }}_custodial" value="custodial"> Child support payments to the custodial parent<br>
                        <input type="checkbox" name="resource_{{ loop.index0 }}_noncustodial" value="noncustodial"> Child support received from the non-custodial parent<br>
                        <input type="checkbox" name="resource_{{ loop.index0 }}_other" value="other"> Other: <span data-field="dependents[{{ loop.index0 }}].other_resource">{{ dependents[loop.index0].other_resource }}</span>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <input type="checkbox" id="more_space" name="more_space">
            <label for="more_space">Check here if more space is needed for dependents and provide a separate page with the student's name and UTA ID at the top.</label>
        </div>

        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
            <h3 style="font-weight: bold;">Certification and Signature</h3>
        </div>

        <p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">Signature must be hand-written and not typed or forged.</p>

        <div class="signature-line">
            <div>
                <p>Student's Signature (Required)</p>
                <div class="signature-box"></div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <p>Date</p>
                <div class="signature-box"></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <p style="margin-top: 60px; font-size: 10pt; text-align: center;">WARNING: If you purposely give false or misleading information, you may be fined, sent to prison, or both.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>